The bytes equal `kernel2/lens2.wasm`. Test 86 passes with `MINDS_KERNEL2_WASM` set to this fresh build. The m-v2-bound and m-4a-kernel-v1 mutants are built separately and killed by that test, checking both the fence and v1-epoch interpretation. The other original G3 kernel mutants are also rebuilt by the runner; no production wasm is modified.

